                                                "sense_id": "d3279206-7a24-3732-b6ec-d69e2ad6341c",
                                                "text": "He made a number of other changes at the Transit Police, including revamping audio equipment, moving the force to nine-millimeter semiautomatic weapons, and designing new uniforms. These changes were all part of a $40 million infusion into the Transit Police in 1990 from Governor Mario Cuomo."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec32ea49-090d-463e-a5f8-2b196a4d8363",
                                                "sense_id": "d3279206-7a24-3732-b6ec-d69e2ad6341c",
                                                "text": "[...] but in the verity of extolment / I take him to be a soul of great article and his infusion / of such dearth and rareness as, to make true diction of / him, his semblable in his mirror, and who else would / trace him, his umbrage, nothing more."
                                            }
                                        ]
